OL,3,GNEWSAYellow wind warning for millions
OL,4,Ain UK as Storm Austen sees thousands
OL,5,Alose power in South West England
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn France, Storm Austen is causing
OL,8,Fsevere transport problems in coastal
OL,9,Fregions in the north-west - with
OL,10,Fthousands without power
OL,12,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,13,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,14,Fwinds to Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,15,Fas well as North West and North East
OL,16,FEngland
OL,18,FAn amber wind warning will kick in from
OL,19,F21:00 tomorrow until Sunday evening
OL,20,Facross much of Scotland, parts of
OL,21,FNorthern Ireland as well as northern
OL,22,FEngland
